 *
 * Generated by scripts/api-sync.php from the `Errors` table of the OpenAPI spec
 * (.api-sync/spec-snapshot.json); `api-sync.php --check` fails when they drift. Do not edit by hand.
 *
 * The set is open: ErrorResponse::$code stays a plain string, so a code the API adds after this
